cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DriftScope"
abstract: >-
  Research-grade audit framework for detecting non-stationarity in streaming
  discrete-valued processes assumed uniform. Three complementary pillars
  (classical stationarity tests, kernel two-sample MMD on frequency vectors,
  pre-registered co-occurrence test) converge on conclusions; every reported
  finding must pass a shuffle test, family-aware FDR correction and a
  specification curve. Flagship case study: EuroJackpot with two known
  change-points (2014, 2022) as ground truth; reusable to PRNG streams and
  other large-alphabet lotteries.
type: software
authors:
